          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"It ain't nothin' but love and crushin' and fuckin'",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"From nothin' to somethin', bumpin' the system, gettin' it jumpin' (Jumpin')",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"All my ladies (Ladies), where you at? (Where you at?)",
