        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Nah, tell me where the money at (Money at)",
          "rhyme":"a",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"I'm seein' stacks right in front of Mac, run with that (Run with that)",
