        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Givin' bitches wood like a lumberjack (Haha)",
          "rhyme":"ak",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"Uh, what's crack-a-lackin'? Mac is rappin' for your satisfaction (Uh-huh)",
          "rhyme":"$",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
