        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"But we gon' keep it jumpin', we gon' keep it jumpin' (Go)",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"I know you want it bad, girl, stop frontin' (Stop frontin')",
          "rhyme":")",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"Oh, I ain't a player, I just crush a lot (Crush a lot)",
          "rhyme":"o",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"And you know that the kid gon' hit the spot (It's all for the)",
